tor":"342434f62e84bd8aafbb0122505412c77060a9bb56e8258db09bbacd07606a6f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c77725d73653dcd54e22e10ff12b8e1f933ab2e317f3ebdfec93365edc4f85ba","logical_entry_identity":"c4fe1195c99661277707b295aed88f7b8b435bb8cd33ed49186e70e9a9b4e8ea","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"orc high cryomancer","source_tag":"entity name","target":"高阶兽人冰霜术士"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ad34238d8b82b04b709af46b87aa6fbde2896ed70c2eee7083917ba42382dff4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c77f9ddc84fa09f56271be3c09d6549d27635738b39a9332627af2e49e3d5a6e","logical_entry_identity":"21fac727bbf2e0c536d7c54d90deda6fe4aca87534f28e6b0f578139e9e4a938","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Thermal Balance","source_tag":"talent name","target":"热能平衡"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"17c1211c10b25d956cc24d397ca2c7338164289d838b6b7b9e32ed362ecf4ade","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c7802f4a713be8a9baafa47850da1a6d8602718ad60a8a589f9737d90cbfc81c","logical_entry_identity":"4b6c64b3186132184d8406a7e7729be668a75ba6c9779c5008880b680aa00a84","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"alchemist spinel","source_tag":"entity name","target":"炼金尖晶石"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0daaf7eace2269ad9e7ed5dbef31dac8a249e011ed5dd1209fa98f7c3b45d5d4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c78422bc55e8bd94308ba237cc75978562c8acc16a41c7bc8ad5ea3c8c5b1552","logical_entry_identity":"5aa918d02e893333661df9911ee2683f8ccd4d7c0107208bcc48ed2bf9682099","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Another body, if one could call it that. Mangled remains strewn about a rocky outcrop, of whom I know not. Only the armour and weapon give tell that it were once an intelligent race. The breastplate still polished and undented, the axe still clean and un-notched, yet the flesh ripped apart like shredded paper. What could do this?!\n\nI did not even attempt to bury the remains. I ran, and as frightful thoughts filled my head the sky turned red and the earth turned black, and spiders appeared with morphing faces. They laughed at me and spun their webs. I tore through them, the strands sticking to my fingers, mucousy remnants dripping over my skin. A surge of revulsion pulsed through me and suddenly the webs evaporated and the spiders coalesced into a giant face, its mouth a red flower. I reached into the midst of the crimson petals and it exploded in a wet mess, blinding all sight and thought.\n\nI woke up with my flesh drenched in blood. Or is it blood? Is it my flesh? The ground rumbles with my every moan, the mists swirl with my every sigh. I am closer to the heart of the caldera now. Closer to finding the truth. The truth of this place. The truth of myself...","source_tag":"_t","target":"又一具尸体——如果那还称得上尸体。我不知道裸露岩石旁散落的残骸属于谁，只有铠甲和武器表明，死者生前属于某个智慧种族。胸甲依旧光洁平整，斧刃依旧干净无缺，血肉却像碎纸一样被撕得七零八落。究竟是什么造成的？！\n\n我甚至没有尝试掩埋残骸。我转身逃跑，恐怖的念头刚涌入脑海，天空便变成红色，大地化作黑色，脸孔不断变形的蜘蛛凭空出现。它们嘲笑我，吐丝结网。我从蛛网中撕出一条路，丝缕粘住手指，黏滑的残丝顺着皮肤淌下。一阵强烈的恶心感贯穿全身，蛛网忽然蒸发，蜘蛛则聚合成一张巨脸，嘴巴是一朵红花。我把手探进猩红的花瓣之间，它顿时炸成一团湿烂之物，遮蔽了我的视野，也淹没了我的思想。\n\n醒来时，我的血肉浸满鲜血。那真是血吗？这是我的血肉吗？我每呻吟一声，大地便隆隆震动；我每叹息一次，雾气便随之盘旋。如今我离火山口的中心更近了，也更接近真相。这里的真相。关于我自己的真相……"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ced1ae164c1dd9ac67dc9a96629c27017a361bdec1631045fd2aee35b1a78a9f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c784616db19b55976913629609ddd20e3a64a83198da41fa66f1f3df4e749cef","logical_entry_identity":"c50f9928977984a8ff2415db3ab8ec2e3f0794dabebfa5fcbb18aa7c221e057e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Filio Flightfond","source_tag":"entity name","target":"菲里奥·弗莱特冯德"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"45ff05c6ab6f940d6390c2347b988c74014de55a8ef8a98cf146b9c767d62e12","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c787c9c956d4bcaface00bc86136b373701a6d385b81bd40bd01a610c647dc74","logical_entry_identity":"c609593fb1bcda5cd9519c9bbeb072bf60b740f6dddfc147038d9836d3531752","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The vast psionic force of the Way reverberates through this gemstone. With a single touch, you can sense overwhelming power, and hear countless thoughts.","source_tag":"_t","target":"维网的庞大灵能力量在这颗宝石之中回响。只需轻轻一触，你就能感受到压倒性的力量，听见无数的思绪。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5d750de6779777b7abfbc6d03e78260b00ddbda89fa61208f761aff3f3f0eebb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c78edca8f5b0d89b56aae83a9902407b33f7e0880552d895809f4b17992bb47b","logical_entry_identity":"d4d002c549b886c4a18c25c5eb455063c6d8b9c485f430efb92ba1ebc7136e5a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Attempts to magically teleport a target slightly farther from you.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"尝试用魔法将目标传送到离你稍远一点的位置。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d8fe6e00b52aee6b5eda9b9603153e3d01335ff531b0a6b8fcea339fa8c52e9e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c78f9bc3aca48e2e423cbfc279021b06d9510e71144669065780e3d8a8e1b091","logical_entry_identity":"4b1f8fdd33551c7364848dc0a0401298bc4bcae7c8e58a78e3a0967a7c9b2941","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"DEBUG -- Create Trap","source_tag":"_t","target":"调试 -- 制造陷阱"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8c1569cde35568fbc4fca6a11cd60dd68e74ec20f8b714f9151423ee875db462","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c78fbb896ec3271b3bf9efca6c0f34d1574c64f4abef8f5af5a75cd49281bff6","logical_entry_identity":"7cfe3c9263a8069c8b8f2bb171aca7c1f99d19bedfd13ea3a001c462f9c83c7c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Activate the rune to create a protective shield absorbing and reflecting at most %d damage for %d turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"激活这个符文产生一个防御护盾，吸收并反弹最多 %d 伤害值，持续 %d 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d632561d44c0223dd82afd2a8b95b33bcf317be2a9cc32373155356e3bf8adab","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c797021a5e079c4a3713265c1429f907792a8bbc66473ce894b4850b2532b0b2","logical_entry_identity":"c143d735786ad018a8be8d90571b5532eb82c6dad6caf3337dc249911b3902e9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s resists the constriction!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s抵抗了缠绕！"},{"args_order":nul